all, particularly when COVID-19 related restrictions are lifted and travel demand increases;
• the significant decline in travel demand as a result of COVID-19, including the current and any future disruptions in airline passenger
traffic;
• the absence of an improvement in, or further deterioration of, economic conditions, particularly during our peak season or in key
